# The golden test fixture is a real child's photo. Held OUT of the remote for
# privacy (pediatric data → hard to reverse once in git history). The golden-frame
# regression test needs it LOCALLY; it stays on disk. Add it back only with explicit
# consent to publish:   git add -f tests/fixtures/golden_S__83238932.jpg
tests/fixtures/golden_S__83238932.jpg
